(The annual fee is due before the end of March each year.) Tj T*
(Students pay a reduced fee of thirty dinars on presentation of their card.) Tj T*
(Late payments incur a penalty of five dinars per month of delay.) Tj T*
(Fees may be paid in cash at the office or by bank transfer.) Tj T*
(Receipts are issued by the treasurer within one week of payment.) Tj T*
